  "video_id": "lzV7ZT2Fdoc",
  "title": "5 Things I Would Build In Claude This Weekend",
  "description": "Most people use Claude like a search bar and get nothing lasting out of it. These five builds change that, and none of them need code.\n\nA life dashboard that pulls your calendar, inbox and tasks into one morning briefing. A second brain holding every contract, lease and note you can question. A daily and weekly review agent. A brand kit built from your own voice. And a life library of everything you have ever read.\n\nEach one is built inside Claude Projects, so it remembers permanently instead of dying with the chat.\n\nGet the full build guide with every prompt here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pqXzWg50zZ_D2DwWJFIqU9pDn0sDLl19efCUSBxgi6c/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeAI #AITools",
